{"id":207,"slug":"207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Kiểu Dữ Liệu & Biến","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?","question_en":"What is the difference between == and ===?","answer_vi":"`==` so sánh **sau khi ép kiểu**; `===` so sánh **cả giá trị lẫn kiểu**, không ép.\n\n```javascript\n0 == '0'        // true  — chuỗi '0' bị ép thành số 0\n0 === '0'       // false — number vs string\n\nnull == undefined   // true  — quy tắc riêng của spec\nnull === undefined  // false\n\n'' == 0         // true\n[] == false     // true  — [] → '' → 0\n\nNaN == NaN      // false\nNaN === NaN     // false — NaN không bằng chính nó, dù == hay ===\n```\n\nBảng ép kiểu của `==` có nhiều trường hợp phản trực giác, đó là lý do gần như mọi bộ quy tắc lint đều bật `eqeqeq`.\n\n**Ngoại lệ duy nhất đáng dùng `==`:** kiểm tra \"null hoặc undefined\" trong một phép so sánh.\n\n```javascript\nif (value == null) { }        // bắt cả null và undefined\nif (value === null || value === undefined) { }   // dài hơn, cùng nghĩa\n```\n\n**Đừng nhầm với `Object.is`:**\n\n```javascript\nObject.is(NaN, NaN)   // true  — khác ===\nObject.is(0, -0)      // false — khác ===\n```\n\n**Chốt:** trả lời được \"`==` ép kiểu\" là mức cơ bản; nêu được `value == null` là cách viết hợp lệ và `Object.is` xử lý `NaN`/`-0` mới là mức trên","answer_en":"`==` compares **after coercion**; `===` compares **value and type**, with no coercion.\n\n```javascript\n0 == '0'        // true  — the string '0' becomes the number 0\n0 === '0'       // false — number vs string\n\nnull == undefined   // true  — a special rule in the spec\nnull === undefined  // false\n\n'' == 0         // true\n[] == false     // true  — [] -> '' -> 0\n\nNaN == NaN      // false\nNaN === NaN     // false — NaN never equals itself, with == or ===\n```\n\nThe `==` coercion table has enough counterintuitive cases that nearly every lint config enables `eqeqeq`.\n\n**The one exception worth using `==` for:** checking \"null or undefined\" in a single comparison.\n\n```javascript\nif (value == null) { }        // catches both null and undefined\nif (value === null || value === undefined) { }   // longer, same meaning\n```\n\n**Do not confuse it with `Object.is`:**\n\n```javascript\nObject.is(NaN, NaN)   // true  — unlike ===\nObject.is(0, -0)      // false — unlike ===\n```\n\n**Takeaway:** saying \"`==` coerces\" is the baseline answer; noting that `value == null` is a legitimate idiom and that `Object.is` handles `NaN`/`-0` is the level above","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>==</code> so sánh <strong>sau khi ép kiểu</strong>; <code>===</code> so sánh <strong>cả giá trị lẫn kiểu</strong>, không ép.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"0 == '0'        // true  — chuỗi '0' bị ép thành số 0\n0 === '0'       // false — number vs string\n\nnull == undefined   // true  — quy tắc riêng của spec\nnull === undefined  // false\n\n'' == 0         // true\n[] == false     // true  — [] → '' → 0\n\nNaN == NaN      // false\nNaN === NaN     // false — NaN không bằng chính nó, dù == hay ===\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> == <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true  — chuỗi &#x27;0&#x27; bị ép thành số 0</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false — number vs string</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> == <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true  — quy tắc riêng của spec</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> === <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span> == <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n[] == <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true  — [] → &#x27;&#x27; → 0</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span> == <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span>      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span> === <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false — NaN không bằng chính nó, dù == hay ===</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Bảng ép kiểu của <code>==</code> có nhiều trường hợp phản trực giác, đó là lý do gần như mọi bộ quy tắc lint đều bật <code>eqeqeq</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Ngoại lệ duy nhất đáng dùng <code>==</code>:</strong> kiểm tra \"null hoặc undefined\" trong một phép so sánh.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"if (value == null) { }        // bắt cả null và undefined\nif (value === null || value === undefined) { }   // dài hơn, cùng nghĩa\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (value == <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>) { }        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// bắt cả null và undefined</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (value === <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> || value === <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>) { }   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// dài hơn, cùng nghĩa</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Đừng nhầm với <code>Object.is</code>:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"Object.is(NaN, NaN)   // true  — khác ===\nObject.is(0, -0)      // false — khác ===\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">is</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true  — khác ===</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">is</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, -<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false — khác ===</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Chốt:</strong> trả lời được \"<code>==</code> ép kiểu\" là mức cơ bản; nêu được <code>value == null</code> là cách viết hợp lệ và <code>Object.is</code> xử lý <code>NaN</code>/<code>-0</code> mới là mức trên.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>==</code> compares <strong>after coercion</strong>; <code>===</code> compares <strong>value and type</strong>, with no coercion.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"0 == '0'        // true  — the string '0' becomes the number 0\n0 === '0'       // false — number vs string\n\nnull == undefined   // true  — a special rule in the spec\nnull === undefined  // false\n\n'' == 0         // true\n[] == false     // true  — [] -&gt; '' -&gt; 0\n\nNaN == NaN      // false\nNaN === NaN     // false — NaN never equals itself, with == or ===\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> == <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true  — the string &#x27;0&#x27; becomes the number 0</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false — number vs string</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> == <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true  — a special rule in the spec</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> === <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span> == <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n[] == <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true  — [] -&gt; &#x27;&#x27; -&gt; 0</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span> == <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span>      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span> === <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false — NaN never equals itself, with == or ===</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">The <code>==</code> coercion table has enough counterintuitive cases that nearly every lint config enables <code>eqeqeq</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>The one exception worth using <code>==</code> for:</strong> checking \"null or undefined\" in a single comparison.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"if (value == null) { }        // catches both null and undefined\nif (value === null || value === undefined) { }   // longer, same meaning\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (value == <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>) { }        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// catches both null and undefined</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (value === <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> || value === <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>) { }   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// longer, same meaning</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Do not confuse it with <code>Object.is</code>:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"Object.is(NaN, NaN)   // true  — unlike ===\nObject.is(0, -0)      // false — unlike ===\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">is</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true  — unlike ===</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">is</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, -<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false — unlike ===</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> saying \"<code>==</code> coerces\" is the baseline answer; noting that <code>value == null</code> is a legitimate idiom and that <code>Object.is</code> handles <code>NaN</code>/<code>-0</code> is the level above.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — Equality comparisons and sameness","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Equality_comparisons_and_sameness"},{"label":"MDN — Strict equality (===)","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Strict_equality"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/212-temporal-dead-zone-tdz-la-gi","title":"Temporal Dead Zone (TDZ) là gì?"}]}